r vi på Aschoff.", "speaker_id": null, "flags": []}, {"start": 55.271, "end": 66.923, "text": "Vi sitter på Grønlandsholm.", "speaker_id": null, "flags": []}, {"start": 67.665, "end": 70.806, "text": " Mia san mia.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02", "flags": []}, {"start": 70.846, "end": 75.467, "text": "Und damit wende ich mich an alle Orten hier im Stadion.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 75.507, "end": 84.409, "text": "Egal in Ober-, Mittel-, Unterland, im Norden, im Westen und im Osten und natürlich auch in der legendären Südkurve.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 84.429, "end": 86.689, "text": "Heute gilt's!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 86.709, "end": 87.789, "text": "Die 5.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 87.809, "end": 89.05, "text": "FC Bayern München!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 89.07, "end": 90.65, "text": "Servus!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 124.751, "end": 128.134, "text": " And now, let there be light.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_01", "flags": []}, {"start": 128.174, "end": 139.382, "text": "Hier ist die Mannschaftsaufstellung des deutschen Rekordmeisters.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 139.402, "end": 142.844, "text": "Hier ist die Mannschaftsaufstellung des FC Bayern München.", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 142.904, "end": 148.948, "text": "In Tor, unser Kapitän mit der Nummer 1, Manuel!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 148.968, "end": 149.729, "text": "Ja!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 155.048, "end": 155.908, "text": " Die 4, Jonathan!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 155.988, "end": 156.589, "text": "Jonathan!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 156.669, "end": 161.49, "text": "Und der Nummer 6, Joshua!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 161.51, "end": 162.21, "text": "Joshua!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 162.23, "end": 162.71, "text": "Die 7, Serge!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 162.73, "end": 162.99, "text": "Serge!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 163.15, "end": 165.711, "text": "Mit der Nummer 9, Harry!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 165.731, "end": 166.331, "text": "Harry!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 166.351, "end": 172.693, "text": "Die 14, Louis!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 172.733, "end": 173.073, "text": "Louis!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 173.113, "end": 175.974, "text": "Mit der 7, Michael!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 175.994, "end": 176.654, "text": "Michael!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 176.714, "end": 177.375, "text": "Und der 27, Konrad!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 177.395, "end": 179.935, "text": "Konrad!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 179.955, "end": 180.996, "text": "Die 44, Joseph!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 181.076, "end": 181.856, "text": "Joseph!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 183.739, "end": 188.508, "text": " Rundumse nummer 45, Janne Kander!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}, {"start": 188.528, "end": 192.355, "text": "Auslösespieler, mein FC Bayern, Kyrgios Hoa, Rundumse nummer 40, Jonas!", "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00", "flags": []}], "words": [{"start": 54.47, "end": 54.57, "word": "Nå", "segment_idx": 0, "speaker_id": null}, {"start": 54.59, "end": 54.63, "word": "er", "segment_idx": 0, "speaker_id": null}, {"start": 54.65, "end": 54.69, "word": "vi", "segment_idx": 0, "speaker_id": null}, {"start": 54.71, "end": 54.75, "word": "på", "segment_idx": 0, "speaker_id": null}, {"start": 54.77, "end": 55.251, "word": "Aschoff.", "segment_idx": 0, "speaker_id": null}, {"start": 55.271, "end